Hmm, I earlier leaned Option A (tier first, then terminal). Let me think about which scenario matters:

Scenario X: quality.yml (score 2) re-run in flight after previous quality.yml failure. Terminal pool = old quality.yml failure (score 2). Active pool = quality.yml in flight (score 2). Same tier → terminal wins → cite = failure. Pre-existing gh-816 behavior (terminal first). Both options agree here (same tier).

